            "reviewBody": "I had already steamed 4 med beets in my iPot when I came here looking for a marinade for them. The weight came to about 13.5 ounces. I basically followed the recipe, but omitted the onions and used Apple Cider Vinegar instead of the white wine vinegar. Very quick, easy and delicious. Will do this again next time.",
